1-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=My%20name%20is%20Bjorn,supposed%20to%20be%20here","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e11","era":null,"summary":"Ranar accepts the quest and feels life begin to return to him.","participants":["ranar-the-ever-watchful","egon"],"location":"istfell","importance":"minor","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":722,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":82,"quote":"Life, distant, nevertheless had begun to fill him like liquid fills a vessel.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Life%2C%20distant%2C%20nevertheless%20had,liquid%20fills%20a%20vessel.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Life%2C%20distant%2C%20nevertheless%20had,liquid%20fills%20a%20vessel.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e12","era":null,"summary":"Bjorn reveals he means to climb a tower built by his ancestors and cut open a passage to Starnheim, and orders Ranar to follow.","participants":["egon","ranar-the-ever-watchful"],"location":"istfell","importance":"minor","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":722,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":96,"quote":"Now I will climb it, and with this sword cut open a passage to Starnheim.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Now%20I%20will%20climb,a%20passage%20to%20Starnheim.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Now%20I%20will%20climb,a%20passage%20to%20Starnheim.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e13","era":null,"summary":"Ranar and Bjorn cut through the Elk King's guard and Bjorn kills the Elk King, taking his crown.","participants":["ranar-the-ever-watchful","egon","elk-king","king-s-guard"],"location":"istfell","importance":"major","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":722,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"He plunged his dagger into the spirit's neck and levered him to the floor.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=He%20plunged%20his%20dagger,him%20to%20the%20floor.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=He%20plunged%20his%20dagger,him%20to%20the%20floor.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e14","era":null,"summary":"Bjorn explains that he must slay three kings, the crow next and the bear last, to open Starnheim.","participants":["egon","ranar-the-ever-watchful"],"location":"istfell","importance":"minor","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":722,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":103,"quote":"We take the crow next, and last the bear, and then Starnheim opens to me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=We%20take%20the%20crow,Starnheim%20opens%20to%20me.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Miguel Lopez"],"date":"2021-01-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=We%20take%20the%20crow,Starnheim%20opens%20to%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Direction. Purpose. Honor. Glory.\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e15","era":null,"summary":"Ranar's hands become whole and flesh-colored as the kills restore life to him.","participants":["ranar-the-ever-watchful"],"location":"istfell","importance":"minor","page":"stories/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29","order":722,"story_date":"2021-01-29","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":110,"quote":"His hands, once the faded green of spiritflesh, were made whole.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/directio